sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Reader
    participant Desk
    participant Catalog
    Reader->>Desk: Request a book
    Desk->>Catalog: Check availability
    alt Available
        Catalog-->>Desk: Copy ready
        Desk-->>Reader: Collect the book
    else Unavailable
        Catalog-->>Desk: No copy yet
        Desk-->>Reader: Offer a reservation
    end
